  'feature-subclass-way-of-mercy-ua-17-hand-of-mercy': { level: 17, name: 'Hand of Mercy', description: 'As an action, touch a creature, spend 4 Focus Points (Ki Points), and force a Constitution saving throw, which the creature may willingly fail. On failure, it enters suspended animation for a number of days equal to your Monk level or until you end it without an action. It is paralyzed, immune to all damage, and its curses, diseases, and poisons are suspended; outward inspection and divination perceive it as dead. Only one creature can be under this effect at a time.' },
